#: src/index.js:114
msgid "Used by Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky, and Threads. Facebook and LinkedIn do not accept a custom message; Reddit uses only the title and URL."
msgstr "Koriste ga Native Share, WhatsApp, email, Telegram, X, Bluesky i Threads. Facebook i LinkedIn ne prihvataju prilagođenu poruku; Reddit koristi samo naslov i URL."

